OL,3,GNEWSADavid Bowie's venue ban lifted for
OL,4,Anew exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn immersive exhibition exploring the
OL,7,Flife and work of a music icon is set to
OL,8,Fbe held at Brighton Dome.
OL,10,FDavid Bowie: You're Not Alone uses
OL,11,Ffilm, photography and audio to showcase
OL,12,Frarely seen material from the David
OL,13,FBowie Archive in New York.
OL,15,FDavid Bowie was banned from Brighton
OL,16,FDome for life after fans tore up seats
OL,17,Fduring a 1973 concert on his Ziggy
OL,18,FStardust tour.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
