OL,3,GNEWSADavid Bowie's venue ban lifted for
OL,4,Anew exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Davies, director and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of Brighton Dome, told the
OL,8,FBBC the venue had "forgiven" Bowie and
OL,9,F"welcomed him back".
